# Jupyter notebooks are paired with a Markdown sibling via jupytext (see
# pyproject.toml's [tool.jupytext]) -- the .md carries the actual code a
# reviewer needs, the .ipynb just adds embedded HTML dashboard output.
# linguist-generated collapses it in GitHub's diff view and is respected by
# most review bots (Macroscope has its own explicit rule too, see
# .macroscope/ignore.md, for tools that don't honor this attribute).
notebooks/*.ipynb linguist-generated=true
